{"id":"695f658f5cc56144","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-base-formula.md","title":"Base Formula Syntax","display":"df-base-formula — Base Formula Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-base-formula","aliases":["90-df-base-formula"],"display":"df-base-formula — Base Formula Syntax","depends_on":["[[90-df-atomic-formula]]","[[90-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-base-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-base-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-base-formula — Base Formula Syntax"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3f5171c34dbb4e9c\" href=\"?note=3f5171c34dbb4e9c\" title=\"90-df-atomic-formula\">90-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8225a5a04158160a\" href=\"?note=8225a5a04158160a\" title=\"90-df-variable\">90-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>；项、原子公式与树构造子取本地依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\land\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\land\\psi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\varphi\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg(\\varphi)\">\\(\\neg(\\varphi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land(\\varphi,\\psi)\">\\(\\land(\\varphi,\\psi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall(x(),\\varphi)\">\\(\\forall(x(),\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 为下式公式集中的元素。上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"88\">\\(88\\)</span> 是保留的接口标识；构造阶段另名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FmlStage}\">\\(\\operatorname{FmlStage}\\)</span>，不占用第 90 本表示自由变量数的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{(r)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}^{(r)}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\land\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\qquad\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda&#39;&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_{\\Lambda&#39;}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\land\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\qquad\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists x\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda&#39;&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_{\\Lambda&#39;}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 使用 base 文件名是为避免覆盖原 90-df-formula；两者通过原语法接口连接，不以构造阶段替换自由变量类型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"3f5171c34dbb4e9c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8225a5a04158160a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-variable]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\land\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\land(\\varphi,\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall(x(),\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"88","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FmlStage}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(0)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88}_\\Lambda,\\\\\n\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n+1)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\n\\cup\\{\\neg\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\cup\\{\\varphi\\land\\psi:\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\varphi:x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\land\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{FmlStage}_\\Lambda(n),\\\\\n\\varphi\\to\\psi&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\qquad\n\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg\\varphi\\land\\neg\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists x\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi,\\qquad\n\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\varphi),\\\\\n\\Lambda\\subseteq\\Lambda'&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_{\\Lambda'}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1985,"backlinks":[{"id":"b24fa26209f44674","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L,\\mathrm{Var}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L,\\mathrm{AtFml}_L,\\mathrm{SynTree}_L,v_i$ 取 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]；$\\operatorname{free}^{88}_{L^\\sharp}$ 取 [[90-df-base-free-variable]]，原始及派生公式构造子取 [[90-df-base-formula]]。"},{"id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"上标 $88$ 和下标 $88$ 是原调用接口的保留拼写，现均由第 90 本本地依赖定义，不要求读取外部文件：$\\mathrm{Var}^{88},\\mathrm{Term}^{88},\\mathrm{AtFml}^{88},\\mathrm{Fml}^{88},\\operatorname{var}^{88},\\operatorname{free}^{88},\\operatorname{FreeFor}^{88}$ 及在可代入域上的 $[t/x]_{88}$ 分别取 [[90-df-variable]]、[[90-df-term]]、[[90-df-atomic